    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-yoga-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Yoga Classes is a serene and modern theme thoughtfully crafted for yoga instructors, studios, fitness trainers, health coaches, holistic practitioners, and wellness centers aiming to establish a professional online presence. Ideal for yoga classes, workshops, online sessions, guided meditations, and breathing exercises, this theme effectively showcases schedules, instructor profiles, client testimonials, pricing, and service packages. It elegantly supports diverse offerings including Hatha yoga, Vinyasa flow, and meditation, providing a calming layout that embodies mindfulness and spiritual balance. With its soothing color palette and graceful imagery, it creates an immersive experience for visitors. Designed to promote a healthy lifestyle, self-care, and mindful practices, the theme also facilitates wellness blogs and fitness content. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it ensures seamless performance across all devices, helping spa businesses and wellness brands grow their online presence effectively using a health coach WordPress approach."
    },
